WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
Comparing and rounding

2
00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:12.533
Two teams picked coffee cherries. The red team picked three hundred forty-eight and the blue team three hundred eighty-four.

3
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:17.633
Both numbers have the same hundreds, so we compare the tens.

4
00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:23.033
Four tens are fewer than eight tens, so three hundred forty-eight is less.

5
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:28.433
On the number line, three hundred forty-eight is closest to three hundred fifty.

6
00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:32.867
Rounded to the nearest hundred, it is three hundred.
